From 7a013c0ffee1234567890abcdef1234567890ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:25:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH panvk-g610 013] panvk: log the layout computed for imported ANB
 images

The ANB buffer is allocated by gralloc, so the only ground truth about
its layout is what gralloc/SurfaceFlinger report (modifier 0x72 on this
device) and what panvk computes.  Seven modifier values - linear,
u-tiled, afbc 0x42, afbc-split, afbc-ytr, afbc-split-ytr (0x72, as
SurfaceFlinger reports) and the 16x16 family - all leave the game black,
so before guessing again, print the numbers panvk derived:

  [P0A-V19-FULLPLANE] layout mod=0x... 2400x1080 hdr_row_stride=...
    surface_stride=... size=... data_size=... wsi_pitch=... strict=...

data_size should equal the imported dmabuf size (10608640 for this
buffer).  If it does not, our AFBC layout is not what gralloc allocated
and no modifier value can fix the presentation.

Tested GPU: none (instrumentation only)
Validation test: one line per imported swapchain image, data_size vs the
  "anb import fd[i] size=" line printed just before it

---
diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_image.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_image.c
index aeecd4a..a30114c 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_image.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_image.c
@@ -550,6 +550,25 @@ panvk_image_init_layouts(struct panvk_image *image,
                             VK_ERROR_INITIALIZATION_FAILED);
       }
 
+      /* panvk-kbase: the imported buffer was allocated by gralloc, so the
+       * only way to know whether our layout is the one gralloc used is to
+       * print what we computed next to the size we were given.
+       */
+      if (explicit_info && image->vk.drm_format_mod != DRM_FORMAT_MOD_LINEAR) {
+         const struct pan_image_layout *l = &pan_img->planes[pan_plane]->layout;
+         const struct pan_image_slice_layout *s = &l->slices[0];
+         mesa_logi("[P0A-V19-FULLPLANE] layout mod=0x%llx %ux%u hdr_row_stride=%u "
+                   "surface_stride=%llu size=%llu data_size=%llu wsi_pitch=%llu strict=%d",
+                   (unsigned long long)image->vk.drm_format_mod,
+                   image->vk.extent.width, image->vk.extent.height,
+                   s->afbc.header.row_stride_B,
+                   (unsigned long long)s->afbc.surface_stride_B,
+                   (unsigned long long)s->size_B,
+                   (unsigned long long)l->data_size_B,
+                   (unsigned long long)plane_layout.wsi_row_pitch_B,
+                   plane_layout.strict);
+      }
+
       if (!is_disjoint(image) && !explicit_info)
          plane_layout.offset_B += image->planes[plane].plane.layout.data_size_B;
    }
